      371.61,
      286.68,
      444.53
    ],
    "text": "I do hereby give notice according to the Sub-section (1) of the 7 th section of the Land Acquisition Act as amended of land Acquisition Act No. 28 of 1964 that the Government is supposed to acquire the Land/right of possessing of the following land for Public Purpose.",
