  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      450.32,
      286.67,
      474.8
    ],
    "text": "That the particulars of the Land/right of possessing to be acquisition\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      478.15,
      286.69,
      610.44
    ],
    "text": "The land situated at Pathiniyarmahilankulam in Thandikulam Grama Niladhari\u2019s Division (No. 214A) in Vavuniya Divisional Secretariat\u2019s Division in the Vavuniya District of the Northern Province. The Extent of the Land is about 0.0092 Hectares according to the Advance Tracing prepared by Surveyor General No. FVP. No. 58 and Dated 14.12.2014 and within the following boundaries. Lot No. 290\u2014Name of the Land: \u201cOyarsinnakula Edam\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      610.4,
      334.18,
      695.6
    ],
    "text": "North by: Lot No. 289; East by: Lot No. 289; South By: Lot Nos. 289, 29 (Road, Pradeshiyahaba); West by: Lot No. 29, (Road Pradeshasabha Lot 289). Claimer\u2019s Name and address: Selliah Vimaleswaran, No. 03, RDD Office\u2019s Quarters, Park Road, Vavuniya.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.52,
      328.37,
      540.86,
      445.49
    ],
    "text": "I do hereby requested to appear before me personally or the Land owners those who have got written power for ownership for the Land and claiming the land/possession in acquisition at the Conference Hall of Divisional Secretariat, Vavuniya at 9.00 a. m. on 28th of November 2016 and to submit with three copies that their nature of the ownership and the amount of compensation and details regarding to calculation of the compensation before 21st of November 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
